# performance: in ACTS, D5 E5 F5 G5 are the pad, bells, bass and drums (a tap mutes, a hold solos; a tap while
# soloed clears the solos); A#3 the breakdown (the bass and drums out on the next bar; again: back after a fill bar);
# HOME twice: the Mix page, the four levels
wait 300
tap SEL
tapkey 23
expect mutes 2
tapkey 23
expect mutes 0
key 26 down
wait 600
key 26 up
expect mutes 0x80
tapkey 21
expect mutes 0
# the breakdown: on the next bar (Pre-show: 84 bpm, a bar 2.86 s)
tapkey 5
expect bd 0
wait 3000
expect bd 1
wait 4000
expect bd 1
tapkey 5
expect bd 1
wait 6500
expect bd 0
# the Mix page: HOME, then HOME again
tap HOME
expect view 1
tap HOME
expect view 8
spin K4 -10
expect par3 20
